{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["How will you describe the problem in the greeting so it's specific but doesn't sell your answer?","Which audiences are you choosing between, and do the first question's options reflect them?","Do you need the age question, or would job, industry or location split your audience better?","Who will run the follow-up conversations, and how quickly can they reach out?"],"howToUseResponses":"Group respondents by who they're solving for, then compare how often the problem comes up and how much it hurts. The audience worth targeting first is usually the one that has the problem often, rates it highly and already spends money on it. Read the written gaps for the words people use, since those make better headlines than your own, and book the follow-up calls while answers are fresh.","customizeSteps":["Rewrite the greeting to describe your problem in one plain sentence, without naming your product.","Change the first question's options to the audiences you are deciding between.","Share the link in communities where each audience gathers, and add a hidden field for the source so you can compare them."],"faqs":[{"q":"What questions should a target market survey include?","a":"Who the person is buying for, how often the problem affects them, how much it hurts, what they use today, who decides and what they'd judge a new option on. Those answers show which group needs you most."},{"q":"How is a target market survey different from market segmentation?","a":"A target market survey asks which audience is the best fit for your offer. Segmentation looks for useful differences inside a market you've already chosen."},{"q":"Should I screen out people who don't have the problem?","a":"Yes. This template asks them one short question and ends, so their answers don't blur the picture of the people who do."},{"q":"How many responses do I need?","a":"Enough from each audience to see a clear pattern, and a handful of follow-up conversations to explain it. A small sample can point the way but can't speak for a whole market."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Target market survey","description":"Test who needs what you're building, before you decide which audience to focus on.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_targetma00","ref":"welcome","title":"We're working on a way to make keeping track of household bills less of a chore, and we're trying to learn who struggles with it most. About three minutes.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_targetma01","ref":"buying_for","title":"Who would you be solving this for?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_just_me","label":"Just me","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_my_household_or","label":"My household or family","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_small_business","label":"A small business I run or work at","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_larger_company","label":"A larger company or organisation","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_targetma02","ref":"how_often","title":"How often does this problem come up for you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_every_day","label":"Every day","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_every_week","label":"Every week","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_few_times","label":"A few times a month","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_rarely","label":"Rarely","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_isn_t","label":"It isn't a problem for me","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_targetma03","ref":"not_a_problem","title":"What makes it a non-issue for you? If you've found something that works, we'd love to know what.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_targetma04","ref":"pain","title":"When it happens, how much does it bother you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":10,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"I barely notice","labelHigh":"It really costs me"},{"id":"blk_targetma05","ref":"current_fix","title":"How do you handle it today?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_a_spreadsheet_or","label":"A spreadsheet or notes","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_an_app_or","label":"An app or piece of software","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_pay_someone","label":"I pay someone to handle it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_ask_friends","label":"I ask friends, family or colleagues","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_just_put","label":"I just put up with it","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":10,"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_targetma06","ref":"current_gaps","title":"What's missing or annoying about the way you handle it now?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":{"askStyle":"If the answer is general, ask for the last time it went wrong and what that cost them.","examples":[]},"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_targetma07","ref":"spent_before","title":"Have you spent money trying to solve this in the past year?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_yes_i_pay","label":"Yes, I pay for something regularly","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_yes_once_or","label":"Yes, once or twice","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no_but_i","label":"No, but I would for the right thing","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_no_and_i","label":"No, and I wouldn't","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_targetma08","ref":"decider","title":"If you found something that worked, who would decide whether to buy it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_me_alone","label":"Me alone","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_me_together_with","label":"Me, together with someone else","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_someone_else","label":"Someone else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_targetma09","ref":"criteria","title":"Rank what would matter most when choosing a new option.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"ranking","items":[{"id":"opt_item_price","label":"Price"},{"id":"opt_item_ease_of","label":"Ease of use"},{"id":"opt_item_time_it","label":"Time it saves"},{"id":"opt_item_a_recommendation","label":"A recommendation from someone I trust"},{"id":"opt_item_reliability","label":"Reliability"},{"id":"opt_item_help_when","label":"Help when I get stuck"}]},{"id":"blk_targetma10","ref":"where_look","title":"Where would you look for a solution?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_search_engines","label":"Search engines","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_social_media","label":"Social media","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_friends_family_or","label":"Friends, family or colleagues","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_review_or_comparison","label":"Review or comparison sites","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_online_communities_and","label":"Online communities and forums","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_app_stores","label":"App stores","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":10,"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_targetma11","ref":"age_group","title":"Which age group are you in?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"opt_18_to_24","label":"18 to 24","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_25_to_34","label":"25 to 34","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_35_to_44","label":"35 to 44","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_45_to_54","label":"45 to 54","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_55_to_64","label":"55 to 64","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_65_or_over","label":"65 or over","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_prefer_not_to","label":"Prefer not to say","image_key":null}]},{"id":"blk_targetma12","ref":"interview","title":"Would you be open to a short follow-up conversation about this?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_targetma13","ref":"interview_email","title":"Great. Which email should we use to arrange it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"email","unique":false,"businessOnly":false,"allowedDomains":[],"verify":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_targetma01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Thanks for your time","bodyMd":"Your answers help us work out who we should build this for first.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_targetma02","ref":"end_not_fit","title":"Thanks, that's useful to know","bodyMd":"Knowing who doesn't have this problem helps us as much as knowing who does. That's all we need from you.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]},{"id":"end_targetma03","ref":"end_interview","title":"Thank you, we'll be in touch 📬","bodyMd":"We'll email you to find a time that suits. It's a conversation, not a sales call.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_targetma01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[],"groups":[]},"from":"not_a_problem","target":"end_not_fit","targetKind":"ending"},{"id":"rl_targetma02","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[],"groups":[]},"from":"interview_email","target":"end_interview","targetKind":"ending"},{"id":"rl_targetma03","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref